{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have a strong lead. Chigozie Obioma was born in Akure, Nigeria, and his novels \"The Fishermen\" (2015) and \"An Orchestra of Minorities\" (2019) were both shortlisted for the Booker Prize and translated into 30 languages. The Booker Prize was established in 1969, not the 2000s, so this doesn't fit the \"award created in the 2000s\" criterion. Let me reconsider.\n\nThe Man Asian Literary Prize (established 2007) fits \"award created in the 2000s.\" Let me check if Obioma's books were contenders for that prize, and verify the connection more carefully.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize shortlist 2010 2011 2012 2013 2014 2015\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize winners list all years\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize 2010s winner shortlist\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_ab718d407d5849d8a2362273","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize established 2007 winners\"], \"top_k\": 5}","name":"search"},"id":"call_7dae26b6056648ebb404375e","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789479359,"id":"chatcmpl-dfd6e81a-c3f6-916b-bfb7-290ae75624e2","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":19973,"completion_tokens":240,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":20213,"cached_tokens":13568,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":13568},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}